{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n油脂極香!二人餐仲包刺身+炸物\n</p>\n<h2>人氣壽喜燒$168黑毛A4和牛套餐！</h2>\n<p>人氣壽喜燒專門店「天澗壽喜屋」主打平價壽喜燒套餐，全店均採用日本A4黑毛和牛。其中最平$168就食到北海道A4黑毛和牛赤身套餐；而二人套餐都只是$498， 即可歎齊鹿兒島A4黑毛和牛肩胛、北海道A4黑毛和牛赤身、北海道豚五花、刺身三點盛、炸物、主食。仲可以優惠價$68追加五款壽司或$198追加海膽刺身！</p>\n<h2>入口即融！鹿兒島A4黑毛和牛</h2>\n<p>產自鹿兒島的黑毛和牛，油花分布細緻均勻，入口甘香不膩，口感柔嫩中帶有彈性。顧客可自行煮食，親手掌握肉類熟度與醬汁濃淡，推薦經典吃法：以牛脂爆香京蔥及洋蔥，略煎和牛後加入店內秘製壽喜燒醬汁煮至入味，再沾上濃香滑嫩的日本無菌蛋液，完美提升牛肉鮮味，將和牛滋味發揮得淋漓盡致。</p>\n<p>天澗壽喜屋<br/>\n地址：尖沙咀堪富利士道 6 – 6A 號爵寓 1 樓<br/>\n電話：<a>3487  1160</a><br/>\n營業時間：星期一至日 12:00 – 22:00<br>\n官方IG：@tenkan_suki_kansai_shabu_shabu</br></p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273522351372945_17775945596adaf7f7e3052.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273522351372945_17775945596adaf7f7e3052.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927352253787750_9793254196adaf7f9c4f47.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927352253787750_9793254196adaf7f9c4f47.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273522712018441_13092127036adaf7fb57e40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273522712018441_13092127036adaf7fb57e40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927352291443938_6478121226adaf7fd7264b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17927352291443938_6478121226adaf7fd7264b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523075795665_2064365086adaf7ff02323.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523075795665_2064365086adaf7ff02323.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523227130030_8779259146adaf80086ff2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523227130030_8779259146adaf80086ff2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523377423530_10738015776adaf801f3abf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179273523377423530_10738015776adaf801f3abf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De0mHw0DfmH/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.423615+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":680,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:00: